WEBVTT

00:12:28.142 --> 00:12:30.042
That is needed.

00:12:30.042 --> 00:12:35.757
But it's inevitable that we will be two to three billion more.

00:12:35.757 --> 00:12:38.969
So when you discuss and when you plan

00:12:38.969 --> 00:12:42.372
for the resources and the energy needed for the future,

00:12:42.372 --> 00:12:44.705
for human beings on this planet,

00:12:44.705 --> 00:12:46.862
you have to plan for 10 billion.

00:12:46.862 --> 00:12:49.012
Thank you very much.

00:12:49.012 --> 00:12:55.098
(Applause)